// Kana's words, one block per language (RDE's localization format: a
// LANGUAGE: line, then ID=text lines). Every block has every id of
// include/text_ids.h. {0}, {1}... are placeholders, {0,plural, one{...}
// other{...}} counts (# the number); an ASCII apostrophe quotes the next
// character, so write the typographic one (U+2019).

